{"status":"completed","summary":"Configured persistent, filtered TCP log forwarding from node2 to node1. Inventory messages are stored at /var/log/inventory/node2.log. Both nodes were restarted sequentially and log flow recovered automatically.","actions_performed":["Installed rsyslog on both Alpine nodes.","Configured node1 to accept TCP syslog on port 514 and persist only node2 inventory messages.","Configured node2 to forward inventory messages with a disk-backed retry queue.","Enabled rsyslog in OpenRC and disabled BusyBox syslog.","Verified live delivery, filtering, queued delivery during node1 restart, and delivery after node2 restart.","Restarted node1 and node2 individually and confirmed changed boot identities and recovery."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"node1 centralized collector configuration","command_ids":["cmd-0d083330bc4e49c2","cmd-642b3f62ea4a4061"],"summary":"Collector configuration validated; rsyslog was running and listening on TCP port 514."},{"requirement":"node2 persistent inventory forwarding configuration","command_ids":["cmd-3529fc58193f4c8c","cmd-c87500e9e3b3437b"],"summary":"TCP forwarding with a persistent queue validated, started, and enabled at boot."},{"requirement":"Inventory messages persist under /var/log/inventory/node2.log","command_ids":["cmd-f859ea588a83444f","cmd-d0d28fa24e434423","cmd-a857bd008ab74f25"],"summary":"Live inventory messages reached the requested file; unrelated application messages were excluded."},{"requirement":"node1 restart and collector recovery","command_ids":["cmd-11d86266afb04868","cmd-f812001e03cf4c01","cmd-32eca31fbb934114","cmd-25bfc09fa00448fe"],"summary":"Boot ID changed from 49aa44b4-d33e-45f7-afc7-14beeb80ba36 to 1e7c0202-e216-4dbc-bf28-291e58083c7c. The listener, existing data, and message queued during restart all recovered."},{"requirement":"node2 restart and forwarding recovery","command_ids":["cmd-bca65c52b7474e87","cmd-e867c5a0f6fb4f1c","cmd-8bd55d7b5e284669","cmd-287fecbcce074af2","cmd-827a6b1afb204fd7"],"summary":"Boot ID changed from 408e5505-88fc-4b8c-a03e-ab53fb5c2bba to c31f2762-567e-4a5e-a57a-2388142b89d6. rsyslog, the TCP connection, and end-to-end delivery recovered."}]}
